@*
    Layout for the public pages: landing, privacy, terms.

    Deliberately bare. Each of those pages carries its own chrome — top bar,
    hero, footer — and rendering them inside MainLayout stacked a second
    navigation above their own, which became unmistakable once the app bar took
    the brand navy.

    No MudBlazor providers here, which is why the three pages using this layout
    are MudBlazor-free: a Mud component rendered under this layout would have no
    MudThemeProvider, MudPopoverProvider or MudSnackbarProvider above it. If a
    marketing page ever needs one, the providers belong here first.
*@

@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@Body
